# Conformance probe pack for value transforms (spec 0.15) on the fixed `bits`
# wire, least-significant-bit-first. Public. One byte per word. One kind per
# group of transforms, selected by the first byte; the last kind has no
# `when` and takes any other message. Exercises the sign of `smag` as the
# most significant bit of the field's value, which in this order is the last
# bit of the field; characters numbered from the field's first bit, each read
# low bit first; little-endian floats; and `swap` with an integer scale.
#
#   smag   0x10  c1 8 bits smag (byte 1); c2 8 bits smag at bit 20 (across
#                bytes 2 and 3); ratio 12 bits smscale:0.5 at bit 28
#   uis    0x11  time_ms 64 bits uiscale:1/1000 (microseconds, little-
#                endian); n 16 bits uiscale:1:-5 swap (big-endian)
#   f32s   0x12  a f32scale:0.5:10; hae f64scale:10
#   chars  0x13  callsign 8 icao6 characters; uid 4 ascii7 characters at
#                bit 56; s1 2 ais6 characters at bit 84
#   octal  0x14  tag 12 bits (4 digits); s2 9 bits (3 digits) at bit 20
#   plain  any   s1 2 ais6 characters at bit 0 (12 bits)
format     conformance-transforms-bits-lsb
version    0.15.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
word_bytes 1
bit_order  lsb
kind    smag
when    0:0:8  16
requires probe.c1
field   probe.c1     0:8:8    smag
field   probe.c2     0:20:8   smag
field   probe.ratio  0:28:12  smscale:0.5
kind    uis
when    0:0:8  17
requires time_ms
field   time_ms      0:8:64   uiscale:1/1000
field   probe.n      0:72:16  uiscale:1:-5  swap
kind    f32s
when    0:0:8  18
requires probe.a
field   probe.a      0:8:32   f32scale:0.5:10
field   hae          0:40:64  f64scale:10
kind    chars
when    0:0:8  19
requires callsign
field   callsign     0:8:48   chars:icao6
field   uid          0:56:28  chars:ascii7
field   probe.s1     0:84:12  chars:ais6
kind    octal
when    0:0:8  20
requires probe.tag
field   probe.tag    0:8:12   octal
field   probe.s2     0:20:9   octal
kind    plain
field   probe.s1     0:0:12   chars:ais6
